-- title:
--   Original finite-activity top-cap predictable negative-mark compensator is antitone along physical strict-prehorizon prefix
-- statement:
--   For the original finite-variation spectrally negative Levy risk reserve and admissible dividend strategy, the time-truncated predictable negative-mark kernel is nonpositive under the discounted gradient condition. As T-T/(n+2) increases, the real predictable compensator V_n decreases monotonically on a common probability-one set. Original prepayment reserve, ruin clock, full negative mark measure and compensation time measure are retained, without introducing fictitious global martingales.

